    <statement><p>Estimate <m>\int_0^{8}x^{2}\, dx</m> using SIMP(4).</p>
<p><m>\int_0^{8}x^{2}\, dx \approx</m> <fillin characters="35" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{2\cdot 160+192}{3}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><m>= 4(0 + 4^{2}) = 64</m> and
RIGHT(2) <m>= 4(4^{2} + 8^{2}) = 320</m>, so
TRAP(2) <m>= 192</m>.



Then
MID(2) <m>= 4( (2)^{2} + (6)^{2} ) = 160</m>.



Thus,
<me>\mbox{SIMP(4)} = {{2\mbox{MID(2)} + \mbox{TRAP(2)}} \over 3} =
    170.667.</me>



</solution>
